<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS4.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.4 Optimal Strategies and Topologies ‣ 4 Capabilities ‣ Sakana Fugu Technical Report" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Bringing in a specialist.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
